  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fixed a CFG007 precision gap found by evidence-based audit: a tuple-deconstruction assignment to ErrorOnUnknownConfiguration (e.g. (options.ErrorOnUnknownConfiguration, options.BindNonPublicProperties) = (true, false);) was invisible to the strict-binding escape-analysis proof, so strict binding that was genuinely enabled at runtime silently fell back to the softer CFG006 Info diagnostic instead of the CFG007 Warning. Diagnostic IDs and severities are unchanged.",
